  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Glorious Arena</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> tension pool, one of bardic performance, psionics, or raging song</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> You may spend 2 points of tension in place of spending a round of bardic performance, psionics, or raging song for any purpose.</p>\n<p>In addition, you gain a unique bardic performance, psionic, or raging song called tempo keeper which you may perform as normal. Each round that you use tempo keeper, you gain 1 additional point of tension.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc64\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
